cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and this archived code."
title: "geodesic-anomaly-test: Information-geometric hypothesis testing on the categorical statistical manifold"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, simulations, and real-data (NSL-KDD) experiment for the
  geodesic (Fisher-Rao) test statistic on the categorical statistical manifold and
  its use for anomaly detection in decision-support systems. Reproduces every figure,
  table, and reported statistic in the accompanying article.
type: software
